  dialogueSequence:
  - text: Rika look! $$$What's up with this black board?$$$ It's got tons of these
      weird scribbles and dates on it.
    displayText: Rika look! What's up with this black board? It's got tons of these
      weird scribbles and dates on it.
    color: 0
